A useful split is emerging: many r2 “includes” are real RCT records without MACE in the abstract, several are protocol/design or pooled/secondary analyses, and a set of NCT-only registry records must stay in the denominator as registry-only records. I’m narrowing the record list now so the classifications are tied to quotes rather than broad memory of trial acronyms.
